      Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَعْفَدَةٌ</span></b>  [inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَعْفَدَ</span>] a compound
word from the phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَعَلَنِى ٱللّٰهُ فِدَاكَ</span> [May God
