say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَعْفَدَهُ</span>, meaning <i>He said to him</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جعلنى اللّٰه</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فداك</span>.]

